{"about_the_game":"If you like to make puzzles, Super Jigsaw Puzzle: Cities is your game.<br><br>Travel the world enjoying its comfortable and intuitive interface and its relaxing music that will allow you to concentrate on the difficult task of solving these beautiful photos that suppose a real challenge for puzzle lovers.<br><br>Solve puzzles to unlock new ones even more difficult. Up to 30! You will always have several available, do not get stuck!<br><br>Drag the pieces to their position, form groups with them or use the available boxes to divide them by colors.<br><br>Configurable snap system to avoid stress.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> New interface design<br></li><li> 30 different puzzles<br></li><li> Autosave, you will not lose your progress<br></li><li> 4 levels of difficulty (40, 80, 200 and 400 pieces)<br></li><li> <strong> You can form groups with the pieces and combine them together </strong><br></li><li> Configurable snap<br></li><li> 5 different interfaces<br></li><li> Relaxing music and atmosphere</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"a3af197e6e88fe8c6d55aa2945c25417125bd237.jpg","localized_name":"All 400 puzzles","name":"All 400 puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862110/a3af197e6e88fe8c6d55aa2945c25417125bd237.jpg"},{"icon":"039a16b1308465909ed09e44ec0746c2f144a96e.jpg","localized_name":"All 200 puzzles","name":"All 200 puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862110/039a16b1308465909ed09e44ec0746c2f144a96e.jpg"},{"icon":"04c44a750ffde6c2f98ff4c1d7548e6976bfd510.jpg","localized_name":"All 80 puzzles","name":"All 80 puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862110/04c44a750ffde6c2f98ff4c1d7548e6976bfd510.jpg"},{"icon":"e8a0c1799cc164aace8920fdd0e8adf6e035663e.jpg","localized_name":"All 40 puzzles","name":"All 40 puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/st